r from an environment variable or a header, and an appropriate error response is returned if no valid key is present. The request sends the file content and a structured prompt to the Gemini model.\n\n\nThe `/api/analyze-bill` endpoint now returns a JSON response directly from the GenAI model, including error handling for exceptions during content generation.  Further investigation of endpoints reveals `/api/clean-items` cleans extracted items, and `/api/process-invoice`, `/api/sanitize-invoice` or `/api/extract-invoice` handle invoice data processing, sanitization, and subtotal calculation, updating the invoice data. These endpoints process various data fields and sanitize the items data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"manage_task","args":{"Action":"list"}}]}
